From: William Emerison Six <billsix@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 8 Sep 2026 00:14:47 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3340/3799] soh: rename D_801120C0 -> gUnusedUCodeData

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence GUESS) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: a u64 array declared beside gJpegUCode that nothing in the tree references
Defined in soh/include/variables.h.

Tagged [LLM:GUESS] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/include/variables.h | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/soh/include/variables.h b/soh/include/variables.h
index 4e02a6c07..9d3ae4826 100644
--- a/soh/include/variables.h
+++ b/soh/include/variables.h
@@ -66,7 +66,7 @@ extern "C"
 	extern u32 __osViIntrCount;
 	extern u32 __osTimerCounter;
 	extern DmaEntry gDmaDataTable[0x60C];
-	extern u64 D_801120C0[];
+	extern u64 gUnusedUCodeData[];  // was D_801120C0 [LLM:GUESS]
 	extern u8 D_80113070[];
 	extern u64 gJpegUCode[];
 	extern EffectSsOverlay gEffectSsOverlayTable[EFFECT_SS_TYPE_MAX];
